    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes! Used an AI tutoring app to summarize theorems and generate practice problems tailored to my skill level. It helped me identify weak areas—like second-order equations—and gave immediate feedback. The high openness in my personality made it easier for me to experiment with tools like this; the structured outputs felt less overwhelming than studying alone.",
